era5-forecast-v1 bundles items derived from ERA5 and from IFS HRES, through WeatherBench 2.

Contains modified Copernicus Climate Change Service information 2026. Neither the European
Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use that may be made of the Copernicus information or
data it contains. ERA5 is CC BY 4.0.

The hidden HRES values are IFS HRES data, European Centre for Medium-Range Weather Forecasts
(ECMWF), CC BY 4.0, through WeatherBench 2.

